{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56446","headline":"金液还丹歌（题拟） 二十二 · 元阳子","name":"金液还丹歌（题拟） 二十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲（一作「要」）识丹砂是木精，移来西位与金幷。\n凡（一作「迷」）人何处寻踪迹（一作「龙虎」），恍惚中（一作「之」）间在（一作「是」）杳冥。\n（此首又见《金液还丹百问诀》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元阳子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}